WEBVTT

01:28.065 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:35.985 --> 01:37.665
She must be Ling Cangcang.

01:38.265 --> 01:40.105
Huan always moves with a goal in mind.

01:40.185 --> 01:42.385
So he is after her.

01:47.945 --> 01:50.225
I've long admired Miss Ling,
your sect's leader,

01:51.385 --> 01:53.185
and always wished to meet her,

01:53.265 --> 01:56.145
but official duties kept me too busy.

01:57.985 --> 02:00.385
Busy with official duties?
Aren't you known for being quite idle?

02:09.465 --> 02:10.785
You've actually met Miss Ling.

02:10.864 --> 02:12.265
She was the one
who tattooed you last time.

02:22.145 --> 02:24.025
With your sect's leader and you

02:24.105 --> 02:25.985
both so brave and clever,

02:27.905 --> 02:30.225
Mr. Bai here must be

02:30.305 --> 02:31.665
no ordinary man either.

02:31.745 --> 02:32.705
Naturally.

02:33.905 --> 02:35.625
Then why not have Mr. Bai

02:35.705 --> 02:37.385
perform a sword dance

02:37.985 --> 02:39.025
to enliven this gathering?

02:48.225 --> 02:49.265
Your Highness,

02:50.025 --> 02:51.385
I don't think that's necessary.

02:51.465 --> 02:53.305
We're swordsmen, not…

02:53.385 --> 02:54.825
Since Your Highness
wishes to be entertained,

02:55.425 --> 02:57.585
I shall oblige.

04:16.624 --> 04:18.145
Has Mr. Bai lost his mind?

04:18.225 --> 04:19.305
How dare he swing at His Highness?

04:19.905 --> 04:21.225
Does he have a death wish?

04:22.825 --> 04:24.345
Do they have some kind of grudge?

04:24.425 --> 04:26.305
His Highness is
Empress Dowager Liu's only son.

04:26.905 --> 04:29.105
Even the Emperor
treads lightly around him.

04:29.185 --> 04:30.345
Who would dare offend him?

04:34.705 --> 04:36.865
Then Bai must be a man of integrity

04:36.945 --> 04:37.945
who fears no authority.

05:05.425 --> 05:06.945
You came all the way to Southern Chu.

05:07.945 --> 05:10.625
You've made quite the effort to marry

05:11.145 --> 05:12.025
the Grand Tutor's daughter.

05:13.025 --> 05:15.545
I'm merely traveling incognito.

05:15.625 --> 05:17.185
You're overreacting.

05:18.785 --> 05:20.105
Traveling incognito?

05:20.705 --> 05:22.625
And you just happened
to come to my territory

05:22.705 --> 05:23.665
and join Fenglai Pavilion?

05:24.265 --> 05:26.225
All under heaven belongs to the Emperor.

05:26.305 --> 05:27.505
If you've done nothing wrong, Qianqing,

05:27.585 --> 05:29.385
why the unease?

05:29.465 --> 05:31.745
Or have you just realized

05:31.825 --> 05:34.625
there's corruption festering

05:34.705 --> 05:35.705
in your domain?

05:55.625 --> 05:57.985
Why is the cold poison flaring now?

06:00.625 --> 06:02.305
Due to my clumsy swordsmanship,

06:02.385 --> 06:03.705
I damaged Your Highness's flowers.

06:05.305 --> 06:06.585
Please forgive me.

06:14.625 --> 06:15.985
Miss Zhong, Mr. Bai,

06:16.865 --> 06:17.945
goodbye.

06:21.025 --> 06:21.945
Your Highness,

06:22.025 --> 06:24.185
the mine incident was
the Lingbi Sect's doing.

06:24.265 --> 06:25.625
Please look into it.

06:26.465 --> 06:27.385
Rest assured, Miss Zhong.

06:27.465 --> 06:28.345
PRINCE OF YUZHANG'S MANOR

06:28.425 --> 06:29.465
I'll investigate

06:29.545 --> 06:31.985
this matter thoroughly.

06:32.065 --> 06:33.265
If there's any progress,

06:33.345 --> 06:34.745
Fenglai Pavilion will be
the first to know.

06:35.425 --> 06:36.985
Good. Thank you, Your Highness.

06:38.305 --> 06:40.825
If I manage to wipe out
the Lingbi Sect entirely,

06:42.185 --> 06:44.425
I wonder how you will thank me, Mr. Bai.

06:46.785 --> 06:48.345
Your Highness already rules over Chu

06:48.425 --> 06:49.825
and has everything one could desire.

06:49.905 --> 06:51.385
Surely there's nothing I can offer.

06:52.225 --> 06:54.665
What if I do have a request?

07:08.025 --> 07:09.025
What did he mean by that?

07:34.065 --> 07:35.145
You're awake?

07:44.345 --> 07:45.545
Where's Cangcang?

07:46.185 --> 07:47.305
She's safe and sound.

07:50.785 --> 07:53.065
The mine has been forced to shut down.

07:53.145 --> 07:55.425
The Lingbi Sect suffered heavy losses.

07:57.305 --> 07:59.865
The Grand Tutor is not pleased.

08:02.105 --> 08:03.465
I failed to live up to Father's trust.

08:04.185 --> 08:05.905
Fortunately, the mine owner is dead.

08:06.905 --> 08:09.585
They won't be able
to trace anything useful.

08:09.665 --> 08:10.705
But that man

08:11.305 --> 08:12.825
won't give up so easily.

08:13.425 --> 08:14.465
If he…

08:15.945 --> 08:16.825
if he uses Cangcang…

08:18.225 --> 08:19.465
Focus on your recovery.

08:20.225 --> 08:22.105
I'll take care of the rest.

08:30.305 --> 08:33.545
PURE INTEGRITY

09:04.705 --> 09:05.865
Shi Yan,

09:06.465 --> 09:08.385
do you think slipping in
and out unseen is the only way

09:08.465 --> 09:10.465
to live up to your title
as a Xiaoxing Guard?

09:14.665 --> 09:16.225
Your Majesty,
how did the cold poison flare up?

09:16.305 --> 09:18.865
Hasn't Preceptor Du's medicine
always kept it under control?

09:21.345 --> 09:22.225
Take this.

09:31.665 --> 09:32.825
The medicine's run out.

09:34.065 --> 09:35.265
You're out of medicine?

09:35.345 --> 09:36.385
Why didn't Li Hongqing
send someone back to fetch more?

09:36.985 --> 09:38.665
-How is he doing his job?
-It's not his fault.

09:39.185 --> 09:40.225
Things have been hectic.

09:40.865 --> 09:42.785
Have the miners been properly settled?

09:43.385 --> 09:44.585
Li Hongqing and I

09:44.665 --> 09:45.785
have already sent people
to escort them home.

09:46.385 --> 09:48.305
But the number of miners we found

09:48.385 --> 09:49.305
doesn't match the number reported missing.

09:51.705 --> 09:54.705
Could some have died in the mine?

09:54.785 --> 09:56.305
We've counted all the bodies,

09:57.025 --> 09:58.065
but the total still falls short by many.

10:00.265 --> 10:02.345
Perhaps some escaped.

10:02.945 --> 10:04.185
No one's been found
returning home on their own.

10:06.425 --> 10:08.825
Then something else is going on here.

10:09.945 --> 10:11.225
I'll keep investigating.

10:12.705 --> 10:15.865
What about that masked young man
in the forest? Any leads?

10:16.465 --> 10:18.545
I never saw him in my past contact
with the Lingbi Sect.

10:19.145 --> 10:21.225
Despite several attempts to investigate,

10:21.825 --> 10:23.145
I found no trace of him.

10:25.505 --> 10:28.225
It seems the Lingbi Sect
is still growing stronger.

10:29.745 --> 10:31.065
Shi Yan,

10:31.145 --> 10:33.945
I have a new mission for you.

10:35.545 --> 10:36.385
At your service.

10:37.385 --> 10:38.545
Strengthen Fenglai Pavilion.

10:40.385 --> 10:43.465
FENGLAI PAVILION

10:47.345 --> 10:48.465
Bai.

10:53.025 --> 10:53.985
You're up early.

10:54.065 --> 10:55.465
You just promoted me to hall master.

10:56.145 --> 10:57.585
Of course I should set an example

10:57.665 --> 10:58.825
for the other disciples.

10:58.905 --> 11:00.305
Looks like I didn't misjudge you.

11:00.385 --> 11:01.465
Really?

11:01.985 --> 11:04.665
Funny. As I recall, you used to keep me

11:04.745 --> 11:05.705
well outside the door.

11:07.065 --> 11:08.065
Did I?

11:08.145 --> 11:11.545
Well, life in the martial world
leaves one little room for trust.

11:12.065 --> 11:15.705
You can never be too cautious.

11:29.665 --> 11:32.265
Bai, I admit it.

11:32.825 --> 11:35.585
I once suspected you were my father's spy,

11:35.665 --> 11:37.265
so I was wary of you.

11:37.345 --> 11:39.585
Then I tricked you into posing
as the Prince of Yuzhang,

11:40.145 --> 11:41.345
and you were injured

11:42.345 --> 11:43.505
and even imprisoned.

11:44.105 --> 11:45.065
That was my fault.

11:52.785 --> 11:54.545
Bai Chifan, I apologize.

12:02.505 --> 12:04.025
Bai… no,

12:04.105 --> 12:06.185
Master Bai, Hall Master Bai,

12:06.265 --> 12:07.985
thank you for not abandoning me in danger

12:08.065 --> 12:10.065
and for sending people to
help Zhong Lin rescue those children.

12:10.665 --> 12:12.185
Bai, I swear,

12:12.265 --> 12:14.985
from now on, I'll see you
as my brother-in-arms at Fenglai Pavilion.

12:15.065 --> 12:16.985
I'll never deceive you or doubt you again.

12:18.665 --> 12:19.865
Hopeless.

12:20.665 --> 12:21.585
You still won't forgive me?

12:23.065 --> 12:25.145
You'd better find a new bookkeeper.

12:28.705 --> 12:30.465
Here, take a look.

12:31.825 --> 12:33.425
Since Fenglai Pavilion was founded
over a year ago,

12:33.505 --> 12:36.225
we've run a deficit of 3,800 liang.

12:37.785 --> 12:39.425
That's why you sighed?

12:40.785 --> 12:41.865
Of course.

12:42.545 --> 12:43.705
That's no big deal.

12:43.785 --> 12:45.825
I'll just steal
a few of my father's paintings or antiques

12:45.905 --> 12:47.145
and make up the loss. There are plenty.

12:48.865 --> 12:50.825
That's not a long-term solution.

12:52.105 --> 12:53.225
Relax, Bai.

12:53.305 --> 12:55.545
Fenglai Pavilion isn't short on money.

12:55.625 --> 12:56.785
Besides,

12:57.705 --> 12:59.105
we've got you, haven't we?

13:06.625 --> 13:07.945
Miss Ling!

13:09.265 --> 13:11.185
Miss Ling,
a big crowd has gathered outside.

13:11.265 --> 13:12.985
They all want to join Fenglai Pavilion!

13:13.065 --> 13:14.105
What?

13:19.505 --> 13:21.425
FENGLAI PAVILION

13:29.625 --> 13:31.345
What were you two talking about just now?

13:31.865 --> 13:33.065
Nothing much.

13:33.145 --> 13:34.545
Nothing much?

13:35.065 --> 13:36.105
I doubt that.

13:36.985 --> 13:38.945
You used to be so wary of him,

13:39.545 --> 13:40.785
but now look at you,

13:40.865 --> 13:44.105
making him a hall master
and calling his name nonstop.

13:45.705 --> 13:47.025
Cangcang,

13:47.105 --> 13:49.145
what exactly happened between you two?

13:50.265 --> 13:51.465
I'll do all I can

13:51.545 --> 13:52.705
so you won't have to act alone.

13:54.625 --> 13:56.225
Really, nothing happened.

13:57.545 --> 13:59.265
He saved my life.

13:59.345 --> 14:00.625
Then we spent
one night together in prison.

14:01.665 --> 14:02.905
One night?

14:04.145 --> 14:05.105
And you call that nothing?

14:05.705 --> 14:07.985
Don't tell me you plan
to repay him with your heart.

14:08.065 --> 14:09.345
What are you…?

14:14.265 --> 14:16.385
-Well, that doesn't sound so bad.
-You…

14:24.105 --> 14:26.825
Don't you think he's

14:27.665 --> 14:29.385
dashing,

14:29.465 --> 14:30.625
charming,

14:31.345 --> 14:33.345
and easy on the eye?

14:33.425 --> 14:34.545
Not one bit.

14:35.905 --> 14:36.985
I think he's

14:37.905 --> 14:38.945
all appearance

14:39.025 --> 14:40.265
and no substance. Absolutely repulsive.

14:43.025 --> 14:44.985
Why do I feel

14:45.945 --> 14:48.585
like his every move

14:49.145 --> 14:50.505
carries a kind of…

14:50.585 --> 14:54.065
A kind of duplicitous danger?

14:55.265 --> 14:58.425
A kind of fatal charm.

14:58.505 --> 14:59.865
You're hopeless!

15:15.025 --> 15:16.465
My name is Shi Yan.
I specialize in the blade,

15:17.145 --> 15:19.105
especially the 72 Kunlun Swift Strikes.

15:19.185 --> 15:20.425
Cangcang, that man

15:20.505 --> 15:23.025
is the one who helped us
rescue the children last time.

15:26.825 --> 15:28.065
That's right. Greetings, Miss Ling.

15:28.665 --> 15:30.305
Very well. You're in.

15:32.625 --> 15:33.625
Miss Ling,

15:33.705 --> 15:35.425
shouldn't you think it over?

15:36.065 --> 15:37.105
What's to think about?

15:37.185 --> 15:38.985
He's Bai's man. I trust him.

15:48.825 --> 15:50.385
Master, I led Fenglai Pavilion

15:50.465 --> 15:52.305
to strike a heavy blow against
that inhumane Refinement Quarry.

15:52.905 --> 15:55.745
We rescued all the children
who'd been taken there by force.

15:56.625 --> 15:59.065
I know you mean to rid the world of evil,

15:59.665 --> 16:00.825
but do you understand

16:00.905 --> 16:03.825
how tangled the powers
behind that mine are?

16:03.905 --> 16:04.905
Of course.

16:04.985 --> 16:06.625
They're all people from the Lingbi Sect.

16:06.705 --> 16:07.545
I even saw

16:09.265 --> 16:10.265
the Ghost King himself.

16:17.705 --> 16:18.945
What is it, Master?

16:22.465 --> 16:23.985
The Ghost King is dangerous.

16:24.665 --> 16:25.505
Yes,

16:25.585 --> 16:27.705
he's committed countless atrocities
and harmed so many people.

16:28.745 --> 16:30.065
And guess what?

16:30.145 --> 16:31.585
They didn't take those children

16:31.665 --> 16:33.425
just to work as slaves.

16:34.145 --> 16:36.505
They were turning
them into stone-like creatures.

16:37.385 --> 16:39.945
There must be a greater plot behind it.

16:42.105 --> 16:44.465
I hear Bai never leaves your side.

16:44.545 --> 16:45.865
His ambitions may

16:45.945 --> 16:47.905
well match the Ghost King's.

16:49.665 --> 16:51.265
Did Zhong Lin say something to you?

16:51.945 --> 16:53.105
I've looked into him.

16:53.185 --> 16:54.865
His identity is false.

16:58.105 --> 16:59.145
I knew that already.

17:05.825 --> 17:06.704
And you still trust him?

17:09.785 --> 17:12.585
Everyone has their own burdens
and secrets.

17:12.665 --> 17:13.825
Just because he hasn't told me the truth

17:13.905 --> 17:15.345
doesn't mean he never will.

17:15.905 --> 17:16.785
I can wait.

17:17.505 --> 17:18.585
Besides,

17:19.105 --> 17:21.985
I've kept my own identity from him too.

17:25.625 --> 17:26.944
The human heart is unpredictable.

17:27.905 --> 17:29.825
He's worked hard to get close to you.

17:30.505 --> 17:31.505
He must have his own agenda.

17:32.785 --> 17:35.905
Perhaps
it has to do with your other identity.

17:39.905 --> 17:41.305
Time reveals all.

17:41.905 --> 17:44.345
Whether he cares for me as
the Sect Leader of Fenglai Pavilion

17:44.425 --> 17:46.305
or as the Grand Tutor's daughter,

17:46.385 --> 17:48.865
I'll find out one day.

17:50.785 --> 17:51.785
Cangcang,

17:52.305 --> 17:54.785
I know you've always been kind

17:54.865 --> 17:57.145
and unwilling to see
the world through suspicion.

17:57.745 --> 18:00.265
But remember, the only person

18:00.785 --> 18:03.905
who loves you without reservation
is your father.

18:04.505 --> 18:07.065
Even I, your master,
am not worthy of your full trust.

18:09.025 --> 18:10.145
How could you say that?

18:10.225 --> 18:11.785
If you hadn't saved me back then,

18:11.865 --> 18:14.665
I would've been taken away and killed.

18:14.745 --> 18:15.785
You saved my life.

18:15.865 --> 18:16.905
If I can't trust you, who can I trust?

18:18.305 --> 18:19.465
Enough, Cangcang.

18:20.465 --> 18:22.785
Your father entrusted you to me,

18:22.865 --> 18:23.785
so I must keep you safe.

18:25.585 --> 18:26.785
Promise me

18:26.865 --> 18:29.345
you'll keep your distance from Bai,
all right?

18:34.345 --> 18:36.665
Now rest. I'll take my leave.

18:42.065 --> 18:43.065
Master…

18:49.545 --> 18:51.105
I received word from
the Prince of Yuzhang's Manor

18:51.185 --> 18:52.225
that His Highness released the Emperor

18:53.105 --> 18:54.385
and started investigating the Lingbi Sect.

18:55.425 --> 18:56.985
Sometimes,

18:57.065 --> 18:59.465
I truly wonder what goes on

18:59.545 --> 19:01.065
in my own son's head.

19:01.145 --> 19:03.025
Please calm down, Your Majesty.
Anger will only harm your health.

19:03.945 --> 19:06.265
How did I give birth
to such a stubborn child?

19:06.345 --> 19:08.465
Instead of seizing
the opportunity to deal with Xiao…

19:11.305 --> 19:13.145
he had to provoke the Lingbi Sect.

19:13.225 --> 19:15.545
Does he know how powerful they are
in the martial world?

19:16.145 --> 19:17.545
What a troublemaker.

19:18.065 --> 19:21.225
-What should we do with the Emperor?
-At this point,

19:22.025 --> 19:23.465
we'll have to take
matters into our own hands.

19:29.665 --> 19:30.865
Bai.

19:30.945 --> 19:32.225
FENGLAI PAVILION

19:34.025 --> 19:35.305
Miss Ling, we've taken in

19:35.385 --> 19:37.065
73 disciples over the past few days.

19:37.145 --> 19:38.025
I've written down

19:38.105 --> 19:40.705
all their details here for you to review.

19:41.585 --> 19:44.745
Good. Bai, thanks for your hard work.

19:44.825 --> 19:45.745
It's nothing.

19:45.825 --> 19:47.625
Earning your trust is what matters.

19:47.705 --> 19:49.865
I just got my hands
on two fine jars of wine.

19:49.945 --> 19:51.105
It's the Lantern Festival.

19:51.185 --> 19:52.465
Let's celebrate.

19:52.545 --> 19:53.385
Celebrate?

19:56.185 --> 19:58.025
FENGLAI PAVILION

20:02.145 --> 20:03.105
Here.

20:09.505 --> 20:11.265
You're in quite the festive mood today.

20:11.865 --> 20:14.945
Good wine should always
be shared with good friends.

20:15.025 --> 20:15.865
Cheers.

20:18.745 --> 20:19.785
Go on and try it.

20:24.185 --> 20:25.065
Excellent wine.

20:27.065 --> 20:28.985
Does it remind you of your hometown?

20:31.065 --> 20:32.985
It's called Sangluo Wine.

20:33.065 --> 20:34.585
"There we sit, sharing Sangluo Wine

20:34.665 --> 20:36.065
and playing with chrysanthemum branches."

20:37.065 --> 20:40.505
It's brewed by the Bai clan of Xiling.
Do you recognize it?

20:43.905 --> 20:46.745
I suppose you've figured out

20:46.825 --> 20:48.945
that I'm not from the Bai clan of Xiling,

20:49.985 --> 20:53.145
yet you still treat me as a close friend.

20:53.225 --> 20:54.945
As close friends,

20:55.025 --> 20:56.825
we should be straightforward
with each other

20:56.905 --> 20:57.745
rather than play tricks.

20:57.825 --> 20:59.185
Very well.

20:59.265 --> 21:00.825
That's exactly what I wanted to hear.

21:02.345 --> 21:03.225
I do

21:03.785 --> 21:05.185
see you as a close friend.

21:06.865 --> 21:09.585
But I still think you haven't
been entirely honest with me.

21:10.985 --> 21:14.025
For instance, I still don't know
who you really are.

21:14.825 --> 21:15.785
What about you, Miss Ling?

21:16.625 --> 21:19.705
Will you tell me your true identity?

21:20.745 --> 21:22.545
That's not the same.

21:22.625 --> 21:24.465
I have secrets I cannot speak of.

21:25.065 --> 21:26.625
How do you know

21:26.705 --> 21:28.185
I have no secrets I must keep?

21:30.145 --> 21:31.145
I…

21:43.305 --> 21:45.505
Since we both carry secrets
we cannot share,

21:46.705 --> 21:50.305
we are not so different after all.

22:16.545 --> 22:17.625
Someone told me

22:18.465 --> 22:20.705
you got close to me with a plan.

22:21.385 --> 22:22.825
Or perhaps…

22:25.385 --> 22:26.225
Perhaps what?

22:29.265 --> 22:30.145
Nothing.

22:34.345 --> 22:37.505
Who said I meant you harm?

22:39.265 --> 22:40.785
Someone I trust.

22:41.385 --> 22:43.745
Have I ever harmed Fenglai Pavilion?

22:46.705 --> 22:48.065
Have I ever hurt you?

22:58.785 --> 22:59.745
Then I suppose

23:00.265 --> 23:02.425
my master is suspicious of you

23:02.505 --> 23:04.345
because he doesn't know you well enough.

23:06.705 --> 23:07.945
So it was your master.

23:09.265 --> 23:10.745
As distance tests a horse's strength,

23:10.825 --> 23:12.065
time reveals a person's heart.

23:13.145 --> 23:15.025
You need not trust me now.

23:15.745 --> 23:16.985
Just…

23:28.625 --> 23:29.505
Bold fools,

23:29.585 --> 23:31.105
how dare you break into Fenglai Pavilion?

23:31.185 --> 23:32.625
You go first. I'll handle them.

23:33.345 --> 23:34.265
We'll fight together.

24:28.825 --> 24:29.865
Look out!

24:40.185 --> 24:41.265
Assassins!

24:50.385 --> 24:51.265
Bai, are you all right?

24:52.585 --> 24:54.625
-Let's go.
-Seize them!

24:56.505 --> 24:57.385
Be careful.

25:05.865 --> 25:06.825
Bai.

25:07.545 --> 25:08.385
Bai?

25:08.905 --> 25:09.865
Bai?

25:12.225 --> 25:13.265
Somebody!

25:13.945 --> 25:15.545
Hurry! Get a physician!

25:18.065 --> 25:18.945
Go after them!

25:21.625 --> 25:22.665
Stop him!

25:32.785 --> 25:34.745
It was a suicide mission.
They all had poison in their mouths.

25:53.025 --> 25:54.865
Sir, how is he?

25:58.945 --> 26:01.825
I've never seen
such a complicated pulse before.

26:01.905 --> 26:02.985
What do you mean?

26:03.065 --> 26:04.585
The poison has invaded
his internal organs.

26:04.665 --> 26:06.065
He won't live long.

26:06.145 --> 26:07.585
Now that he's lost so much blood,

26:07.665 --> 26:09.105
his pulse should be weak.

26:09.185 --> 26:10.385
-But…
-But what?

26:10.465 --> 26:13.825
But his pulse is still strong and steady.

26:13.905 --> 26:15.665
Then why hasn't he woken up?

26:16.265 --> 26:18.665
That's what baffles me.

26:18.745 --> 26:19.825
You said the poison had

26:20.665 --> 26:21.745
reached his internal organs.
What does that mean?

26:22.345 --> 26:23.825
Judging by his pulse,

26:23.905 --> 26:25.145
he's suffering from cold poison.

26:25.225 --> 26:28.345
It must have been
in his body for over ten years.

26:28.425 --> 26:29.545
Impossible.

26:29.625 --> 26:31.225
He seemed perfectly fine,

26:31.305 --> 26:32.825
and his martial skills are extraordinary.

26:32.905 --> 26:33.745
How could that be?

26:34.345 --> 26:35.385
Then it makes sense.

26:35.465 --> 26:37.505
His martial arts training has allowed him

26:37.585 --> 26:39.665
to keep the poison
in check with inner force.

26:39.745 --> 26:43.185
That's why his pulse
remains strong despite the blood loss.

26:43.265 --> 26:45.305
He must have been taking
an antidote regularly.

26:46.745 --> 26:47.825
Antidote?

26:48.585 --> 26:49.625
What is this?

26:52.225 --> 26:53.345
A life-saving medicine.

26:59.065 --> 27:01.465
He gave me his last pill.

27:01.545 --> 27:03.865
Then you must find him
another one at once.

27:03.945 --> 27:05.345
Shi Yan must know about the antidote.

27:06.305 --> 27:08.065
-Hurry. Get Shi Yan here.
-Got it.

27:08.145 --> 27:09.105
Shi Yan!

27:10.825 --> 27:12.665
-Do you have Hall Master Bai's antidote?
-What happened to him?

27:12.745 --> 27:13.705
He fainted.

27:13.785 --> 27:14.905
The physician said he needed the antidote.

27:14.985 --> 27:16.305
I'll be right back.

27:26.145 --> 27:28.145
Bai, you fool.

27:28.905 --> 27:31.225
That antidote was meant
to save your own life,

27:32.745 --> 27:33.945
yet you gave it to me.

27:35.265 --> 27:37.785
You risked your life for me
again and again,

27:37.865 --> 27:40.025
yet I still doubted you.

27:42.385 --> 27:43.985
Master only grew suspicious of you

27:44.665 --> 27:46.705
because he didn't know you.

27:47.225 --> 27:49.665
But deep down,
I'd already come to trust you.

27:49.745 --> 27:51.465
I shouldn't have tested you.

27:53.265 --> 27:54.585
It was my fault.

27:54.665 --> 27:56.385
You haven't even heard my apology yet,

27:57.385 --> 27:59.305
so you can't die.

28:03.025 --> 28:05.225
Please, wake up soon.

28:19.905 --> 28:22.945
Please, wake up soon.

28:33.465 --> 28:34.385
Cangcang,

28:35.305 --> 28:36.545
what's wrong?

28:37.745 --> 28:38.825
Bai,

28:41.425 --> 28:42.625
you're really awake.

28:44.905 --> 28:45.905
You've been crying?

28:46.705 --> 28:48.145
I…

28:48.745 --> 28:49.705
I haven't.

28:50.465 --> 28:52.425
I was just a little scared.

28:57.785 --> 28:58.625
Don't worry.

28:59.305 --> 29:00.465
It'll take more than this to kill me.

29:05.105 --> 29:06.305
I had a dream.

29:06.865 --> 29:08.185
In it, I was wandering near death's door.

29:09.145 --> 29:10.705
Then suddenly, someone called my name.

29:10.785 --> 29:12.225
When I turned around,

29:12.745 --> 29:13.865
I saw that it was you,
crying your eyes out.

29:14.625 --> 29:16.105
I couldn't help but laugh.

29:16.185 --> 29:18.665
Then I woke up.

29:19.385 --> 29:22.025
You're making fun of me
at a time like this?

29:26.865 --> 29:29.145
Did I hurt you?

29:29.225 --> 29:30.145
I'm fine.

29:30.665 --> 29:32.465
You were worried about me?

29:32.545 --> 29:33.465
Of course.

29:33.985 --> 29:35.665
When I got sick as a child,

29:35.745 --> 29:37.945
my father would stay up all night
by my bedside too.

29:39.785 --> 29:42.105
Are you close to your father?

29:47.025 --> 29:50.025
My mother passed away
when I was very young.

29:52.105 --> 29:54.145
Father raised me on his own.

29:56.585 --> 29:58.585
Then how could he allow you

29:58.665 --> 30:00.185
to wander the martial world alone?

30:01.145 --> 30:02.665
Because I have my master.

30:05.465 --> 30:08.065
No wonder your master's words
carry such weight.

30:12.585 --> 30:13.585
Bai,

30:14.385 --> 30:18.105
my master only doubts you

30:18.185 --> 30:20.305
because he doesn't know you.

30:20.385 --> 30:21.305
Don't worry.

30:21.385 --> 30:23.025
I'll make sure

30:23.105 --> 30:24.945
he trusts you

30:25.025 --> 30:27.145
as much as I do, all right?

30:31.665 --> 30:33.945
Now, get some more rest.

30:34.025 --> 30:36.425
I'll go check on the antidote.

30:37.665 --> 30:38.985
Wait.

31:14.425 --> 31:15.305
Did you get the antidote?

31:15.385 --> 31:17.145
The Imperial Preceptor just made it.
Why the rush?

31:17.225 --> 31:18.185
His Majesty's cold poison has flared up.

31:18.265 --> 31:19.105
How could that happen?

31:19.185 --> 31:20.505
It's complicated. Let's head back first.

31:43.585 --> 31:45.665
You're in this condition
and still planning to go out?

31:46.265 --> 31:47.465
I'm going to take Cangcang away.

31:47.545 --> 31:48.545
In your state,

31:49.145 --> 31:51.025
even if you see her, what can you do?

31:51.625 --> 31:53.625
Cangcang is naive and easily deceived.

31:54.305 --> 31:55.265
I'm taking her back to the Capital.

31:55.345 --> 31:57.865
Whether by deceit or by force,

31:58.385 --> 31:59.225
I'm taking her back.

32:02.305 --> 32:05.345
The Lingbi Sect's affair
is what matters most right now.

32:05.425 --> 32:07.545
If they really uncover something,

32:07.625 --> 32:09.105
how should we answer to the master?

32:10.585 --> 32:11.945
Father ordered me to protect Cangcang.

32:12.745 --> 32:13.905
If anything happens to her,

32:14.905 --> 32:15.945
how will I face him?

32:19.265 --> 32:21.225
Are you doing this
for your adoptive father's sake

32:21.825 --> 32:23.625
or for your own?

32:23.705 --> 32:25.545
You know the answer better than I do.

32:36.025 --> 32:38.705
So Your Majesty
gave the antidote to Miss Ling.

32:39.825 --> 32:41.305
I failed to notice

32:41.385 --> 32:43.385
Your Majesty's relapse earlier.
I deserve punishment.

32:43.465 --> 32:46.505
I've had this cold poison since birth.

32:46.585 --> 32:48.425
After all these years, I'm used to it.

32:49.265 --> 32:51.145
Have you traced the assassins?

32:51.225 --> 32:52.905
I let one escape on purpose

32:52.985 --> 32:54.505
and sent the Xiaoxing Guards after him.

32:54.585 --> 32:55.665
He eventually turned up

32:56.265 --> 32:57.385
at the Prince of Yuzhang's Manor.

32:59.105 --> 33:00.745
The Prince of Yuzhang's Manor?

33:04.265 --> 33:05.345
Your Majesty,

33:05.425 --> 33:07.185
we may have found a clue
about the murder thralls at the mine.

33:13.385 --> 33:14.665
What is it?

33:15.585 --> 33:16.865
The Botang Pleasure Boat.

33:17.825 --> 33:20.105
-The Botang Pleasure Boat?
-The Botang Pleasure Boat

33:20.185 --> 33:22.385
is not that well-known,
but I've heard of it.

33:23.105 --> 33:24.745
Despite its name,
it offers no pleasure of that sort.

33:24.825 --> 33:27.065
Rare and valuable items are
auctioned there. It's highly exclusive.

33:27.945 --> 33:30.785
It's said that one must have

33:30.865 --> 33:32.545
a special invitation to board.

33:35.625 --> 33:37.065
Zhong Lin can handle that.

33:37.985 --> 33:39.105
I want to see it for myself.

33:39.985 --> 33:41.665
PRINCE OF YUZHANG'S MANOR

33:41.745 --> 33:42.705
You still haven't

33:42.785 --> 33:44.385
found the Ghost King?

33:45.065 --> 33:47.345
What have you all been doing?

33:48.025 --> 33:49.025
At this rate,

33:49.105 --> 33:51.105
when will you catch him

33:51.185 --> 33:52.385
and root out the Lingbi Sect?

33:53.265 --> 33:54.945
Make the Ghost King
show himself in three days,

33:55.585 --> 33:58.505
-or bring me your heads!
-Understood!

34:02.345 --> 34:04.825
Your Highness,
Bai Chifan from Fenglai Pavilion

34:04.905 --> 34:06.225
just sent word.

34:06.865 --> 34:08.025
What is it?

34:09.425 --> 34:11.665
Three words: Botang Pleasure Boat.

34:47.985 --> 34:49.344
Why does he

34:50.264 --> 34:51.545
look different today?

34:52.145 --> 34:53.105
Was he always like this?

35:05.385 --> 35:06.585
Good morning, Miss Ling.

35:10.105 --> 35:11.145
Good morning.

35:12.985 --> 35:14.425
Are you feeling better?

35:15.105 --> 35:15.985
Much better.

35:16.065 --> 35:17.865
Thank you
for taking care of me last night.

35:21.025 --> 35:23.665
After all, you were hurt because of me.

35:23.745 --> 35:27.305
It's only right that I look after you.

35:28.145 --> 35:30.305
Why do you seem different today?

35:30.905 --> 35:31.865
So uneasy.

35:32.665 --> 35:33.545
Do I?

35:37.025 --> 35:38.985
-Is it because of last night…?
-No!

35:40.145 --> 35:41.185
What?

35:42.785 --> 35:43.985
I…

35:46.905 --> 35:48.105
I…

35:49.345 --> 35:51.265
I feel a little dizzy.

35:53.265 --> 35:56.025
Maybe I'm coming down with something.

35:59.265 --> 36:00.585
I should go.

36:16.225 --> 36:17.705
Your pulse is racing.

36:17.785 --> 36:19.265
That's not quite normal.

36:20.865 --> 36:23.505
But your complexion doesn't look like
that of someone ill.

36:24.145 --> 36:25.305
Is something bothering you?

36:27.385 --> 36:29.225
How about I take you out

36:30.025 --> 36:31.265
for some fresh air?

36:42.705 --> 36:44.225
Hurry, honey.

36:44.305 --> 36:46.065
I heard the boat had a Harmony Chamber,

36:46.145 --> 36:47.025
and only couples are allowed inside.

36:47.705 --> 36:50.145
A trip on this boat
without a fair lady for company

36:50.225 --> 36:52.185
-would be a waste indeed.
-It'll be a sleepless night.

36:52.265 --> 36:53.665
A night of romance…

36:53.745 --> 36:54.665
-Wait.
-…is what makes the trip worthwhile.

36:55.545 --> 36:57.305
Why did you bring me here
dressed like this?

36:58.025 --> 36:59.825
Look around.

36:59.905 --> 37:02.225
Isn't it obvious what we're here for?

37:04.665 --> 37:05.665
Then I'm not going.

37:06.185 --> 37:07.225
You can't back out now.

37:08.105 --> 37:09.785
Everything's ready. Only you're missing.

37:09.865 --> 37:10.865
What?

37:10.945 --> 37:13.345
Yes, I've roamed the martial world
and care little for rules,

37:13.425 --> 37:14.625
but I'm not that kind of girl.

37:15.505 --> 37:18.105
What does that have to do
with rescuing missing youths?

37:19.465 --> 37:20.385
What missing youths?

37:21.665 --> 37:23.505
The number of rescued miners didn't match
the missing count.

37:23.585 --> 37:26.065
I suspect many were sold here.

37:26.665 --> 37:28.465
That's why I invited you along.

37:29.505 --> 37:30.585
Anything wrong with that?

37:36.105 --> 37:37.225
Nothing.

37:38.545 --> 37:39.385
Let's go, then.

37:46.745 --> 37:48.585
You two look unfamiliar.

37:48.665 --> 37:50.305
First time aboard?

37:52.865 --> 37:54.105
A green haitang blossom?

37:55.185 --> 37:56.545
Distinguished guests indeed.

37:56.625 --> 37:58.625
Sir and madam, this way, please.

37:58.705 --> 38:00.505
Sir and madam?

38:03.025 --> 38:05.425
After you, honey.

38:13.065 --> 38:15.025
The boat is setting sail!

38:15.665 --> 38:17.385
Setting sail? Why?

38:18.145 --> 38:19.345
You truly are newcomers.

38:19.425 --> 38:21.585
The boat sails to open waters

38:21.665 --> 38:22.585
before trading begins.

38:25.945 --> 38:27.505
Once it's out at sea,

38:27.585 --> 38:29.265
Shi Yan's men on shore

38:29.345 --> 38:30.945
will be of no use.

38:31.025 --> 38:33.105
Sir and madam, come.

38:41.505 --> 38:43.625
-Look at his fan.
-I know.

38:44.225 --> 38:46.425
-Isn't that…?
-He looks

38:47.065 --> 38:48.665
so dignified.

38:48.745 --> 38:49.945
Who would've thought?

38:50.025 --> 38:50.945
What a pity.

38:51.625 --> 38:52.985
-Who would've thought?
-Exactly.

38:53.065 --> 38:53.945
Let's go.

38:54.625 --> 38:56.705
-Did you see that?
-A green haitang blossom!

38:56.785 --> 38:57.625
Did you see it?

38:57.705 --> 38:59.905
-Yes, I saw it.
-What do the different colors

38:59.985 --> 39:01.865
-even mean?
-I have no idea.

39:01.945 --> 39:03.185
Everyone's staring at us.

39:03.265 --> 39:06.105
Zhong Lin said she saw an invitation
with a green haitang blossom,

39:06.185 --> 39:07.425
so she made one just like it.

39:07.985 --> 39:09.985
Maybe we should slip away while we can.

39:12.145 --> 39:13.585
Come, honey.

39:13.665 --> 39:14.785
I'm not your honey.

39:16.185 --> 39:17.625
If we're acting,
we should make it convincing.

39:18.185 --> 39:20.225
Don't forget why we're here, honey.

39:20.785 --> 39:21.945
Sir and madam,

39:22.465 --> 39:23.785
this way, please.

39:25.745 --> 39:26.705
Let's go, honey.

39:39.705 --> 39:40.585
Please come in.

39:45.985 --> 39:47.345
Come on, honey.

39:47.425 --> 39:48.265
Sit.

39:51.065 --> 39:52.745
Playing the loving couple
in the Green Haitang Chamber?

39:52.825 --> 39:53.785
Aren't you tired?

39:53.865 --> 39:54.705
Xiaoyang, mind your tongue.

39:54.785 --> 39:57.265
They're guests. Serve them tea.

40:00.105 --> 40:01.425
What would you like?

40:02.225 --> 40:04.225
That depends on what you have to offer.

40:04.305 --> 40:05.945
Tiger, snake,
and lion parts, dragon pills,

40:06.025 --> 40:07.985
invincibility pills,
prepared salt, and stink bugs.

40:08.065 --> 40:09.585
As long as you can pay,

40:09.665 --> 40:11.745
we have whatever you desire.

40:11.825 --> 40:13.745
And how brave you are, sir.

40:13.825 --> 40:16.705
We rarely see male guests
in the Green Haitang Chamber.

40:18.585 --> 40:20.745
-Did you see that?
-A green haitang blossom!

40:20.825 --> 40:23.185
-Did you see that?
-He looks dashing.

40:23.265 --> 40:24.585
-Who would've thought?
-Exactly.

40:34.745 --> 40:36.385
Such a shame.

40:42.945 --> 40:45.305
You don't understand what's going on.

40:45.385 --> 40:47.185
Keep quiet. Let me handle this.

40:51.705 --> 40:53.305
Now, that's not very nice to say.

40:53.905 --> 40:56.025
My husband and I share true affection.

40:56.105 --> 40:58.665
I won't despise him
just because he's frail.

40:58.745 --> 41:01.505
No matter what happens to him,

41:02.985 --> 41:05.265
-I'll love him all the same.
-How touching.

41:05.345 --> 41:07.145
For such devotion,

41:07.225 --> 41:09.665
I'll give you a discount.

41:09.745 --> 41:11.225
Here's the thing, madam.

41:11.305 --> 41:12.265
Ordinary medicine

41:12.345 --> 41:13.545
doesn't work

41:14.145 --> 41:16.785
on my husband.

41:16.865 --> 41:18.745
Then what are you saying, madam?

41:19.945 --> 41:21.225
I mean,

41:21.305 --> 41:22.985
on a grand pleasure boat like this,

41:23.065 --> 41:26.185
surely there are other chambers
that can help him.

41:26.265 --> 41:28.465
The red, yellow, and blue
haitang chambers.

41:28.545 --> 41:29.745
What are they all for?

41:29.825 --> 41:32.985
Besides medicine, what else can we try?

41:33.065 --> 41:34.905
Do you look down on my chamber?

41:34.985 --> 41:36.465
Not at all.

41:36.545 --> 41:38.465
I don't doubt
the quality of your goods, madam.

41:38.545 --> 41:39.705
It's…

41:40.825 --> 41:43.305
it's my husband's body I don't trust.

41:45.185 --> 41:46.745
Say something, my love.

41:46.825 --> 41:48.945
All these years, has any medicine

41:49.505 --> 41:50.545
worked for you?

41:52.825 --> 41:53.825
Well,

41:54.425 --> 41:55.905
none so far.

41:58.785 --> 42:00.705
Madam, you heard him.

42:00.785 --> 42:02.025
Please, help us.

42:02.105 --> 42:03.945
Let us enter the other types of chambers.

42:13.225 --> 42:15.265
Sir and madam, please leave.

42:15.345 --> 42:16.185
Go that way.

42:16.265 --> 42:17.785
A boat will take you ashore.

42:18.825 --> 42:20.465
Don't you claim to fulfill
every wish here?

42:20.545 --> 42:22.905
Why drive us out simply for not buying
your medicine?

42:22.985 --> 42:25.105
That's how
the Botang Pleasure Boat operates.

42:25.185 --> 42:26.185
If you refuse to leave,

42:26.265 --> 42:28.025
you'll be thrown overboard
to feed the fish.

42:28.105 --> 42:30.185
Don't make this hard.

42:30.705 --> 42:32.985
If we're thrown out now,
this trip will be for nothing.

42:33.065 --> 42:33.905
I know.

42:33.985 --> 42:35.185
As Sect Leader of Fenglai Pavilion,

42:35.265 --> 42:36.185
I won't take this lying down.

42:36.265 --> 42:37.345
Go.

42:37.425 --> 42:38.385
Wait.

42:39.945 --> 42:40.825
Those

42:41.705 --> 42:44.505
animal parts, dragon pills, and whatnot.

42:45.145 --> 42:45.985
We'll buy them.

42:48.705 --> 42:49.625
My love,

42:50.585 --> 42:52.745
get… get the money.

42:57.665 --> 43:00.625
In that case, sir and madam,
please follow me.

43:15.185 --> 43:16.425
Sir and madam,

43:16.505 --> 43:17.385
follow me.

43:28.025 --> 43:29.585
Sir and madam, upstairs, please.

43:29.665 --> 43:30.505
Can't we go in there?

43:30.585 --> 43:31.825
We have an invitation.

43:31.905 --> 43:34.385
Please, go upstairs
to the Green Haitang Chamber.

43:34.465 --> 43:35.785
This young lady is a distinguished guest.
